Scope of this licence

This licence covers Zonked's original code, documentation, original templates,
mascot and icons. It does not cover these items, which keep their own terms,
listed in NOTICE:

- legacy/ : third-party reference material. legacy/android is GPLv3 (see
  legacy/android/LICENSE). It is not shipped by the app.
- web/public/samples/ : nature loops under CC0 1.0 or released into the public
  domain by their authors (see docs/SAMPLES-LICENSES.md).
- web/public/fonts/ : Atkinson Hyperlegible Next under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1 (see web/public/fonts/OFL.txt).
- Third-party packages, under the licences in their own packages.
